    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come Fight Me! Step into the chaos and fight your way through waves of relentless challengers in Come Fight Me! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413950/extras/983de2b48482655193b7da344d6f8398.poster.avif?t=1736150993\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413950/extras/983de2b48482655193b7da344d6f8398.webm?t=1736150993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413950/extras/983de2b48482655193b7da344d6f8398.mp4?t=1736150993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch: Use fast reflexes and directional controls to unleash powerful attacks and knock enemies out of your way.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413950/extras/090b4547bb53f136c8484e46077c7167.avif?t=1736150993\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, Intuitive Controls: Press up, down, left, and right to execute precise and devastating moves.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413950/extras/ae8e725f2be4f0265a3a0363fefa1250.avif?t=1736150993\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Action: Test your endurance in a non-stop brawl and see how far you can go against the relentless stream of intruders.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413950/extras/f895df7ea19e4a3832d848e6a81c449f.avif?t=1736150993\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage mode: Fill up your rage mode and unleash devastating attacks.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413950/extras/b374d890b1e51f20551bbb88cc4bb0b4.avif?t=1736150993\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you defend your stage? Jump into the action and find out!</p>",
